Time(h)":72,"IC50_Dark(M*10^-6)":16.02,"IC50_Dark_value":16.02,"Method":"CCK-8","DOI":"10.1021/acs.jmedchem.2c01924","Year":2023,"Type":"IC50","comparison":{"compound_id":"OBMD011700","measurement_id":"MCTM-049765","value":"1.33","numeric":1.33}},{"Measurement_ID":"MCTM-049766","Abbreviation_in_the_article":"TPP-Pt","Cell_line":"HUVEC","Time(h)":72,"IC50_Dark(M*10^-6)":16.09,"IC50_Dark_value":16.09,"Method":"CCK-8","DOI":"10.1021/acs.jmedchem.2c01924","Year":2023,"Type":"IC50","comparison":{"compound_id":"OBMD011700","measurement_id":"MCTM-049766","value":"1.63","numeric":1.63}}],"logp":[{"abbreviation_in_the_article":"PMT","value":-0.64,"value_relation":"=","type_authors":"logP","method":"shake-flask","aqueous_phase":"phosphate buffer","pH":7.4,"temperature_C":25,"doi":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.8b01707","year":2018,"counterion":"[Br-]","record_id":"MLDB-001909","detection":"UV-Vis","method_description":"Lipophilicity was measured in a 1-octanol/buffer system using the shake-flask method.25 Solutions of PMT and PDT (100, 150, and 200 μM) were prepared in the phosphate buffer (10 mM, pH 7.4) presaturated with 1-octanol. Equal volumes (2.0 mL) of the solution and 1-octanol presaturated with the phosphate buffer were mixed and placed in a thermostatic (25.0 ± 0.1 °C) air-bath orbital shaker at 200 rpm for 4 h. The samples were separated into two phases after centrifugation at 2500 rpm for 15 min. The concentration of the solute in the aqueous phase was determined by spectrophotometry (λmax = 267 nm). According to the law of mass conservation, the drug concentration of the corresponding 1-octanol phase and the lipo-hydro partition coefficient Po/w (Po/w = Co/Cw = Ao/Aw, A stands for absorbance) were calculated."}]}